@startuml
title FrioTrack DDD tactical model - target design
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
left to right direction
note as Scope
Target design. TB1 uses a supporting API with a private JSON store.
Typed DDD aggregates, EF Core, PostgreSQL and event dispatch remain planned.
Core and supporting contexts precede generic IAM.
end note
package "Shipment Management [Core]" {
class Shipment <<AggregateRoot>> {
  - id: UUID
  - code: String
  - organizationId: UUID
  - coordinatorId: UUID
  - clientId: UUID
  - cargo: String
  - weightTons: Decimal
  - origin: String
  - destination: String
  - range: ThermalRange
  - plannedDeparture: DateTimeOffset
  - estimatedArrival: DateTimeOffset
  - status: ShipmentStatus
  - version: Int64
  + schedule(): void
  + startTransit(): void
  + markDelivered(): void
  + cancel(reason: String): void
  + updateRange(range: ThermalRange): void
}
class ThermalRange <<ValueObject>> {
  - minTempC: Decimal
  - maxTempC: Decimal
  - minHumidityPct: Decimal
  - maxHumidityPct: Decimal
  - toleranceMinutes: Integer
  + contains(tempC, humidityPct): Boolean
}
class ShipmentHistoryEvent <<Entity>> {
  - id: UUID
  - actorId: UUID
  - action: String
  - fromStatus: ShipmentStatus?
  - toStatus: ShipmentStatus?
  - note: String
  - recordedAt: DateTimeOffset
}
enum ShipmentStatus {
  DRAFT
  SCHEDULED
  IN_TRANSIT
  DELIVERED
  CANCELLED
}
interface IShipmentRepository <<DomainPort>> {
  + find(id: UUID): Shipment?
  + save(root: Shipment): void
}
note as Rules1
La raíz protege rango, fechas, peso y transiciones; un borrador no reserva recursos.
La aplicación confirma capacidad y reserva de Fleet antes de aceptar programación, en una unidad de trabajo.
Referencias a organización, coordinador y cliente son IDs; no se navegan objetos de IAM ni de Fleet.
end note
IShipmentRepository ..> Shipment : Persiste la raíz
Shipment "1" *-- "1" ThermalRange : Rango propio del envío
Shipment "1" *-- "0..*" ShipmentHistoryEvent : Historial dentro del agregado
Shipment --> ShipmentStatus : Tipo de estado
}
package "Monitoring and Telemetry [Core]" {
class ShipmentMonitoring <<AggregateRoot>> {
  - id: UUID
  - shipmentId: UUID
  - range: MonitoredRange
  - maxSilenceMinutes: Integer
  - signalStatus: SignalStatus
  - lastReadingAt: DateTimeOffset?
  - startedAt: DateTimeOffset
  - stoppedAt: DateTimeOffset?
  + start(range: MonitoredRange): void
  + recordReading(reading: SensorReading): void
  + recordPosition(position: PositionReport): void
  + detectCommunicationGap(at): void
  + stop(at: DateTimeOffset): void
}
class MonitoredRange <<ValueObject>> {
  - minTempC: Decimal
  - maxTempC: Decimal
  - minHumidityPct: Decimal
  - maxHumidityPct: Decimal
  - toleranceMinutes: Integer
  + contains(tempC, humidityPct): Boolean
}
class SensorReading <<Entity>> {
  - id: Int64
  - monitoringId: UUID
  - temperatureC: Decimal
  - humidityPct: Decimal
  - withinBothRanges: Boolean
  - recordedAt: DateTimeOffset
  + evaluate(range: MonitoredRange): Boolean
}
class PositionReport <<Entity>> {
  - id: Int64
  - monitoringId: UUID
  - latitude: Decimal
  - longitude: Decimal
  - recordedAt: DateTimeOffset
}
enum SignalStatus {
  ONLINE
  NO_SIGNAL
}
interface IShipmentMonitoringRepository <<DomainPort>> {
  + find(id: UUID): ShipmentMonitoring?
  + save(root: ShipmentMonitoring): void
}
note as Rules2
La copia MonitoredRange no cambia cuando se modifican límites de otro envío o contexto.
Las lecturas usan fecha de medición válida. Una muestra atrasada no demuestra recuperación actual de señal.
SignalLost / SignalRestored son eventos propuestos; las excursiones térmicas se evalúan de forma independiente.
end note
IShipmentMonitoringRepository ..> ShipmentMonitoring : Persiste la raíz
ShipmentMonitoring "1" *-- "1" MonitoredRange : Copia local de los cuatro límites
ShipmentMonitoring "1" *-- "0..*" SensorReading : Lecturas del monitoreo
ShipmentMonitoring "1" *-- "0..*" PositionReport : Posiciones del monitoreo
ShipmentMonitoring --> SignalStatus : Estado de comunicación
}
package "Fleet and Resources [Supporting]" {
class Vehicle <<AggregateRoot>> {
  - id: UUID
  - organizationId: UUID
  - plate: String
  - capacityTons: Decimal
  - enabled: Boolean
  + changeCapacity(tons: Decimal): void
  + ensureEnabled(): void
  + disable(): void
}
interface IVehicleRepository <<DomainPort>> {
  + find(id: UUID): Vehicle?
  + save(root: Vehicle): void
}
class Driver <<AggregateRoot>> {
  - id: UUID
  - organizationId: UUID
  - fullName: String
  - licenseNumber: String
  - enabled: Boolean
  + ensureEnabled(): void
  + disable(): void
}
interface IDriverRepository <<DomainPort>> {
  + find(id: UUID): Driver?
  + save(root: Driver): void
}
class Sensor <<AggregateRoot>> {
  - id: UUID
  - vehicleId: UUID?
  - serialCode: String
  - enabled: Boolean
  + assignToVehicle(vehicleId: UUID): void
  + unassign(): void
  + disable(): void
}
interface ISensorRepository <<DomainPort>> {
  + find(id: UUID): Sensor?
  + save(root: Sensor): void
}
class FleetAllocation <<AggregateRoot>> {
  - id: UUID
  - shipmentId: UUID
  - vehicleId: UUID
  - driverId: UUID
  - reservedFrom: DateTimeOffset
  - reservedUntil: DateTimeOffset
  - status: AllocationStatus
  - releasedAt: DateTimeOffset?
  + reserve(): void
  + release(at: DateTimeOffset): void
}
interface IFleetAllocationRepository <<DomainPort>> {
  + find(id: UUID): FleetAllocation?
  + save(root: FleetAllocation): void
}
enum AllocationStatus {
  RESERVED
  RELEASED
}
note as Rules3
No existe composición Vehicle → Sensor: inventario, activación y asignación del sensor tienen ciclo de vida propio.
La asignación referencia shipmentId, vehicleId y driverId; el servicio de aplicación coordina repositorios y unidad de trabajo.
Unicidad de placa, licencia y serial; asignación única de sensor; reserva sin solapamiento bajo control transaccional.
end note
IVehicleRepository ..> Vehicle : Persiste la raíz
IDriverRepository ..> Driver : Persiste la raíz
ISensorRepository ..> Sensor : Persiste la raíz
IFleetAllocationRepository ..> FleetAllocation : Persiste la raíz
Sensor ..> Vehicle : vehicleId? · referencia por ID
}
package "Alert and Reporting [Supporting]" {
class Alert <<AggregateRoot>> {
  - id: UUID
  - shipmentId: UUID
  - triggerReadingId: Int64?
  - type: AlertType
  - severity: AlertSeverity
  - status: AlertStatus
  - openedAt: DateTimeOffset
  - acknowledgedAt: DateTimeOffset?
  - resolvedAt: DateTimeOffset?
  + acknowledge(action: CorrectiveAction): void
  + resolve(evidence: RecoveryEvidence): void
}
class CorrectiveAction <<Entity>> {
  - id: UUID
  - registeredBy: UUID
  - comment: String
  - notifyClient: Boolean
  - registeredAt: DateTimeOffset
}
class RecoveryEvidence <<ValueObject>> {
  - readingId: Int64
  - shipmentId: UUID
  - recordedAt: DateTimeOffset
  - signalRestored: Boolean
  - withinBothRanges: Boolean
  + resolves(type, openedAt): Boolean
}
class Notification <<AggregateRoot>> {
  - id: UUID
  - userId: UUID
  - shipmentId: UUID
  - alertId: UUID?
  - kind: String
  - createdAt: DateTimeOffset
  - readAt: DateTimeOffset?
  + markRead(at: DateTimeOffset): void
}
class Incident <<AggregateRoot>> {
  - id: UUID
  - shipmentId: UUID
  - registeredBy: UUID
  - description: String
  - registeredAt: DateTimeOffset
}
class ThermalReport <<AggregateRoot>> {
  - id: UUID
  - shipmentId: UUID
  - generatedBy: UUID
  - generatedAt: DateTimeOffset
  - filePath: String
  - summary: JsonSnapshot
  + generateSnapshot(shipmentId: UUID): void
}
interface IAlertRepository <<DomainPort>> {
  + find(id: UUID): Alert?
  + save(root: Alert): void
}
interface INotificationRepository <<DomainPort>> {
  + find(id: UUID): Notification?
  + save(root: Notification): void
}
interface IIncidentRepository <<DomainPort>> {
  + find(id: UUID): Incident?
  + save(root: Incident): void
}
interface IThermalReportRepository <<DomainPort>> {
  + find(id: UUID): ThermalReport?
  + save(root: ThermalReport): void
}
enum AlertTypes {
  AlertType = TEMPERATURE | HUMIDITY | NO_SIGNAL
  AlertStatus = ACTIVE | ACKNOWLEDGED | RESOLVED
  AlertSeverity = WARNING | CRITICAL
}
note as Rules4
TEMPERATURE / HUMIDITY: una lectura posterior normal dentro de ambos rangos puede resolver la excursión.
NO_SIGNAL: lectura válida y reciente que restablece señal; puede coexistir con una excursión térmica que sigue abierta.
La notificación se dirige al cliente asignado. Marcar leída requiere acción del destinatario; no se ejecuta al enviarla.
end note
Alert "1" *-- "0..*" CorrectiveAction : Acciones dentro del agregado
Alert ..> RecoveryEvidence : Valida evidencia local, sin entidad de Monitoring
IAlertRepository ..> Alert : Persiste raíz Alert
INotificationRepository ..> Notification : Persiste raíz
IIncidentRepository ..> Incident : Persiste raíz
IThermalReportRepository ..> ThermalReport : Persiste raíz
}
package "IAM [Generic]" {
class Organization <<AggregateRoot>> {
  - id: UUID
  - name: String
  + rename(name: String): void
}
class UserAccount <<AggregateRoot>> {
  - id: UUID
  - organizationId: UUID
  - email: String
  - passwordHash: String
  - fullName: String
  - role: UserRole
  - preferredLanguage: String
  - enabled: Boolean
  - failedAttempts: Integer
  - lockedUntil: DateTimeOffset?
  + ensureActive(at): void
  + changePassword(newHash: String): void
  + updateProfile(name, language): void
  + registerFailedAttempt(at): void
}
class PasswordResetToken <<Entity>> {
  - id: UUID
  - tokenHash: String
  - expiresAt: DateTimeOffset
  - usedAt: DateTimeOffset?
  + isValid(at: DateTimeOffset): Boolean
  + markUsed(at: DateTimeOffset): void
}
enum UserRole {
  LOGISTICS_COORDINATOR
  CARGO_CLIENT
}
interface IOrganizationRepository <<DomainPort>> {
  + find(id: UUID): Organization?
  + save(root: Organization): void
}
interface IUserAccountRepository <<DomainPort>> {
  + find(id: UUID): UserAccount?
  + save(root: UserAccount): void
}
note as Rules5
El registro público requiere consentimiento, correo único y contraseña de al menos 12 caracteres; asigna CARGO_CLIENT.
La aplicación verifica credenciales mediante un adaptador de hash; el dominio recibe y conserva el hash, nunca texto plano.
La recuperación por correo y el bloqueo por cuenta son diseño futuro; TB1 utiliza sesiones opacas y limitación por IP.
end note
IOrganizationRepository ..> Organization : Persiste la raíz
IUserAccountRepository ..> UserAccount : Persiste la raíz
UserAccount "1" *-- "0..*" PasswordResetToken : Tokens de recuperación propios
UserAccount ..> Organization : organizationId · referencia por ID
UserAccount --> UserRole : Rol de cuenta
}
Shipment ..> UserAccount : clientId / coordinatorId
Shipment ..> Organization : organizationId
FleetAllocation ..> Shipment : shipmentId
FleetAllocation ..> Vehicle : vehicleId
FleetAllocation ..> Driver : driverId
ShipmentMonitoring ..> Shipment : shipmentId
Alert ..> Shipment : shipmentId
Notification ..> UserAccount : userId
Notification ..> Shipment : shipmentId
ThermalReport ..> Shipment : shipmentId
Incident ..> Shipment : shipmentId
UserAccount ..> Organization : organizationId
@enduml
